  <data name="AboutPage_Description.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>SiteCheck checks your own sites from the outside: encryption, security headers, cookies, exposed files and the mail setup (MX, SPF, DKIM, DMARC, reverse DNS). The standard run makes a few ordinary requests and DNS lookups, slowly, and stops at the first rejection. Sensitive paths and the stress test only run after you confirm, because a hosting provider can block your connection for them.</value>
  </data>
