  <data name="Dialog_HostNotice_Advice" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>That is why SiteCheck requests slowly and stops at the first rejection. A block cannot be ruled out entirely from the outside. It is safer to have your own address allowlisted by your hosting provider, if they offer that.</value>
